WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:29.860
Let's do this.

00:00:30.120 --> 00:00:33.210
See the light in a place where you battle with your power and might

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.660
For the challenge that will come along

00:00:35.660 --> 00:00:37.060
You never quit, never give up

00:00:37.060 --> 00:00:38.040
You are mighty and strong

00:00:38.040 --> 00:00:40.560
When evil strikes, you gather all your strength to fight back

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:42.920
All the victory is yours in every deadly attack

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:33.090
It's just you do what it's right

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:25.620
on this boat? About a month already. Go check the stern.

00:02:59.240 --> 00:02:59.960
I'll go take a look.

00:03:18.430 --> 00:03:19.970
Hey, Kang, have you seen Wang?

00:03:21.580 --> 00:03:28.570
What's wrong? What is it?

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:31.230
Uh!

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:36.620
Uh!

00:03:37.760 --> 00:03:37.820
Uh!

00:03:41.560 --> 00:03:42.260
Uh!

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:09.780
I'm a monster.

00:05:39.340 --> 00:05:47.520
I'm a reporter from the North TV News, and this is a live news update.

00:05:47.940 --> 00:05:52.080
As you can see, we're here in the East Dak Pot, where a horrible incident occurred last night.

00:05:52.300 --> 00:05:54.780
Three fishermen were allegedly attacked by a monster.

00:05:55.970 --> 00:05:57.710
Sir, could you tell us what happened last night?

00:05:57.870 --> 00:05:59.970
An SOS was sent to the Coast Guard about a monster.

00:06:00.120 --> 00:06:03.240
This is the fourth weird case this week.

00:06:04.110 --> 00:06:06.980
Doctors say the patients lose some brain function.

00:06:07.700 --> 00:06:10.100
In short, the patients lose their memories.

00:06:10.910 --> 00:06:12.430
That's terrible.

00:06:39.560 --> 00:06:41.670
Well then, looks like it's showtime.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:56.320
Hey boss, guess what? I've got a big scoop. It'll be really explosive.

00:07:00.830 --> 00:07:04.890
Are you kidding me? How many times have you made explosive stories?

00:07:05.580 --> 00:07:07.780
Do you see this front cover right here?

00:07:08.090 --> 00:07:09.970
This is what I call explosive. Look at it.

00:07:09.970 --> 00:07:13.560
But this time, boss, I've obtained important evidence for a mysterious case.

00:07:13.760 --> 00:07:17.240
And with it, I'll soon be able to contact and meet the Armor Heroes.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:21.220
Then, they'll give me an exclusive interview that'll shock all of mass media.

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:23.450
Armor Heroes?

00:07:23.610 --> 00:07:23.850
Yeah!

00:07:24.720 --> 00:07:25.200
Explain.

00:07:25.540 --> 00:07:29.960
As you'll see, boss, the attack of the fisherman last night by this monster is definitely beyond...

00:07:30.780 --> 00:07:40.380
Ah, sir, the only way to get the Armor Hero's undivided attention

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:43.320
is by finding the source of this mysterious green liquid.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:46.200
Then I'll take several close-up shots for the cover of our magazine.

00:07:47.050 --> 00:07:49.290
Sure enough, we'll be making a ton of money.

00:07:51.180 --> 00:07:54.920
Jimmy, are you crazy? Or just plain stupid?

00:07:55.190 --> 00:07:57.110
This magazine needs gossip.

00:07:58.520 --> 00:07:59.980
Nowadays, people only c—

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:03.360
care about scandalous dating photos of stars like Brad and Angelina.

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:06.440
I hope you're clear about what this magazine really needs.

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:11.400
I didn't hire you just so you could waste time by taking photos of superheroes.

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:17.260
Right now, you need to keep an eye out for celebrities and take their photos for the magazine's

00:08:17.260 --> 00:08:17.860
next issue.

00:08:19.000 --> 00:08:24.120
Otherwise, you're fired and I'll have to find a better photographer, idiot.

00:08:24.300 --> 00:08:26.250
Now I need to get this story.

00:09:31.790 --> 00:09:38.300
Thank you. Bye. Auntie, how was it?

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:40.420
Not bad. What do you think, Annie?

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:43.370
You've already won the prize. What else can I say?

00:09:43.570 --> 00:09:46.470
You were great, but there were too many fans.

00:09:46.960 --> 00:09:48.840
I bet you couldn't concentrate very well.

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.350
May I have your autograph?

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:52.890
Okay.

00:09:54.350 --> 00:09:56.750
Wow! My cousin's becoming a superstar.

00:09:57.210 --> 00:09:59.150
And soon everyone will ask for his autograph.

00:10:01.240 --> 00:10:03.180
For a little girl, he talked like an adult.

00:10:03.460 --> 00:10:03.940
Exactly!

00:10:06.040 --> 00:10:08.370
Eric, your mother always said,

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.670
a proper man is a modest man,

00:10:10.950 --> 00:10:12.690
so I hope you won't let a simple achievement

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.720
go to your head, honey. Are we agreed?

00:10:15.000 --> 00:10:16.540
Oh, where's Theresa?

00:10:17.180 --> 00:10:19.280
Uh, she left Turley because she was gonna

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:20.360
make dumplings for you.

00:10:20.700 --> 00:10:21.720
Let's go home then.

00:10:22.480 --> 00:10:28.560
Go through the northern entrance.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:41.980
Sam, your mission is to retrieve the blood samples of the victims attacked yesterday and the monster's venom sample.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:43.290
You must use Delta.

00:10:43.790 --> 00:10:47.610
The hospital security is equipped with a fireball. Proceed with caution.

00:10:48.150 --> 00:10:48.630
Got it.

00:11:02.080 --> 00:11:04.540
How much time do I have?

00:11:08.590 --> 00:11:09.590
About 70 seconds.

00:11:10.340 --> 00:11:12.120
Alright, let's hurry up then.

00:11:13.160 --> 00:11:14.460
Go to the third room on your left.

00:11:14.850 --> 00:11:16.030
The lab's in the last room.

00:11:17.200 --> 00:11:17.780
Let's rock.

00:11:19.770 --> 00:11:21.050
Careful, someone's about to enter.

00:12:13.020 --> 00:12:13.880
Someone's in the elevator.

00:12:14.160 --> 00:12:14.960
You have 10 seconds.

00:12:15.320 --> 00:12:22.910
You only have five seconds.

00:12:27.580 --> 00:12:28.260
Someone's at the door.

00:12:44.680 --> 00:12:46.600
Sam will lose contact in five seconds.

00:13:00.640 --> 00:13:01.340
Nice work.

00:13:45.870 --> 00:13:47.630
I feel so happy today. It's just so wonderful.

00:13:48.670 --> 00:13:51.090
Teresa, you should have seen what happened this morning, darling.

00:13:51.910 --> 00:13:56.090
Eric won the first prize and the fans were cheering ever so loudly for my darling boy!

00:13:57.140 --> 00:13:59.020
Eric's getting really popular, isn't he?

00:13:59.060 --> 00:13:59.660
He is!

00:14:00.730 --> 00:14:04.770
And as his dear aunt, I'll be sure to throw him a big celebration.

00:14:05.620 --> 00:14:10.790
And for now, in this city, he's number one.

00:14:11.460 --> 00:14:14.500
But tomorrow, he'll be number one in the whole country.

00:14:15.090 --> 00:14:18.870
Eric is now one step closer to fulfilling his mother's ultimate dream.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:27.990
Lisa, thank you so much. Thank you for coming to help me today.

00:14:28.680 --> 00:14:29.980
You're very welcome, Mrs. Bell.

00:14:30.000 --> 00:14:33.770
Well, you've always taken care of me and I rarely get to return your kindness.

00:14:34.390 --> 00:14:39.630
But more importantly, I also want to learn the art of making great dumplings from someone like you.

00:14:39.890 --> 00:14:40.150
Really?

00:14:40.740 --> 00:14:44.820
Then, if you put your heart into it, you'll be able to cook anything you want.

00:14:44.840 --> 00:14:46.680
Mom, I'm really hungry.

00:14:46.960 --> 00:14:49.780
Oh, okay honey, we'll be done soon. Teresa, put those in the pot.

00:14:56.260 --> 00:14:58.960
John, my faithful follower.

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:02.780
I hope you notice the slow movement of our progress.

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:05.420
Your Highness, after thousands of years,

00:15:05.840 --> 00:15:10.500
to find out if all the descendants of the Light and Shadow Villagers are in the same city

00:15:11.920 --> 00:15:14.580
still takes a lot of time, Master.

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:23.160
Besides, we could just destroy the different sets of Light Armors.

00:15:23.980 --> 00:15:28.820
After that, even if the village descendants stand against us,

00:15:29.000 --> 00:15:29.980
they wouldn't have-

00:15:30.000 --> 00:15:37.860
a chance they lose master continue to search for the village descendants as well as destroy the

00:15:37.860 --> 00:15:44.060
light armors history tells us that there are five sets of light armors and though it's difficult

00:15:44.060 --> 00:15:50.740
to destroy them completely we can still eliminate the inherited memories of the remaining light

00:15:50.740 --> 00:15:58.900
village descendants this will render them unable to wield the light armors furthermore it will

00:15:58.900 --> 00:15:59.880
prevent them from

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:07.690
Passing on the armor, and this, John, is the only way for my goals to achieve completion.

00:16:08.780 --> 00:16:09.700
That's true!

00:16:17.560 --> 00:16:23.150
These light village descendants will not escape from us.

00:16:25.960 --> 00:16:29.120
Aww, he's just some history nerd.

00:16:30.640 --> 00:16:35.740
This job got easier, and so, your highness, allow me to deal with this one personally.

00:17:02.940 --> 00:17:04.560
IDENTIFICATION CONFIRMED

00:17:23.780 --> 00:17:24.280
Hi Liz

00:17:24.280 --> 00:17:27.980
Hey Eric, you can go inside and do some combat training

00:17:27.980 --> 00:17:29.980
We're still analyzing the venom and the blood

00:17:30.000 --> 00:17:43.450
sample. Alright. Combat hologram begins in five seconds. Virtual training system

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:49.700
activated. Five, four, three, two, one.

00:18:02.490 --> 00:18:28.170
To Fire Armor.

00:18:28.910 --> 00:18:29.090
Hello.

00:18:30.220 --> 00:18:32.440
Before we start, I'd like to ask a question.

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:34.370
Go ahead.

00:18:35.460 --> 00:18:38.460
Tell me, which technique will I benefit from the most?

00:18:40.460 --> 00:18:42.080
Let's start the lesson first.

00:18:43.310 --> 00:18:45.690
Today, we will learn the Flaming Fist.

00:18:46.360 --> 00:18:48.220
One of the five elemental strikes.

00:18:53.360 --> 00:18:53.560
Good.

00:18:57.900 --> 00:18:59.300
Your fists must be fast.

00:18:59.730 --> 00:18:59.970
You must...

00:19:00.000 --> 00:19:01.600
You must learn to move like a flame.

00:19:11.280 --> 00:19:16.100
Master the attack, you must learn to forget the...

00:19:17.140 --> 00:19:17.820
Forget the attack?

00:19:17.940 --> 00:19:22.540
Yes, you must calm your distracted mind and become one with your surroundings.

00:19:33.930 --> 00:19:34.090
Huuu!

00:20:00.160 --> 00:20:18.760
enemies and with enough hard work you will soon master it that wasn't bad

00:20:18.760 --> 00:20:24.640
Eric looking at the results your blood temperature has risen from 30% to 35%

00:20:24.640 --> 00:20:29.520
next your heart rate has lowered to 62 beats per minute from 64 beats per

00:20:29.520 --> 00:20:29.760
minute

00:20:30.190 --> 00:20:34.230
You lasted 39 minutes in a solo flight from your previous 38-minute record.

00:20:34.390 --> 00:20:34.810
Good job.

00:20:35.890 --> 00:20:36.710
And we're done.

00:20:38.060 --> 00:20:39.000
Eric, join us.

00:20:45.880 --> 00:20:48.120
The analysis of the green liquid shows that...

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:48.660
I had to go.

00:20:49.100 --> 00:20:50.400
I have a piano recital.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:53.380
You two can call me when you have a plan.

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:54.320
Eric.

00:20:54.480 --> 00:20:54.640
Wait.

00:20:54.800 --> 00:20:55.260
Don't go yet.

00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:59.980
Don't you care at all about all the victims and the threat this monster poses?

00:21:00.000 --> 00:21:02.040
Are you blind? Are you that selfish?

00:21:04.380 --> 00:21:06.250
Eric, do you really have to go?

00:21:07.090 --> 00:21:09.090
Everyone has different ideas and concerns.

00:21:12.310 --> 00:21:14.290
My only concern should be finishing my missions.

00:21:14.590 --> 00:21:18.270
How dare you say that, you fool!

00:21:18.450 --> 00:21:22.350
Sam, it's okay. I can understand Eric.

00:21:24.030 --> 00:21:27.010
His only dream is to become the greatest pianist in the country.

00:21:28.470 --> 00:21:29.690
In honor of his mother.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:33.360
Try to understand him, please.

00:22:27.000 --> 00:22:28.280
Hi, what can I get for you?

00:22:28.570 --> 00:22:29.510
Uh, what's on the menu?

00:22:29.710 --> 00:22:29.970
Uh, let's...

00:22:30.000 --> 00:22:34.020
Let's see, we have burgers, sandwiches, soda and orange juice.

00:22:34.300 --> 00:22:37.850
I'll have a burger and a cold soda with ice. Thank you.

00:22:37.990 --> 00:22:44.780
Sure, I'll be right back. Here.

00:22:45.720 --> 00:22:46.000
Thanks.

00:22:57.730 --> 00:22:58.970
And here's your burger.

00:22:59.210 --> 00:22:59.710
Oh, thank you.

00:23:00.000 --> 00:23:04.810
Oh, Liz. Picking up strange pollution and energy readings.

00:23:05.050 --> 00:23:05.970
Now for an emergency update.

00:23:06.540 --> 00:23:09.480
A monster is terrorizing Dock 7 in West Beijing,

00:23:10.050 --> 00:23:12.330
where it has begun covering the entire area...

00:23:12.330 --> 00:23:14.580
Dock 7 on Foo Street? That's near Eric's house.

00:23:14.840 --> 00:23:15.240
Eric.

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:16.300
Oh.

00:23:31.760 --> 00:23:35.280
Eric, a monster's attacking. It's in Zox 7's back alley. Go there at once.

00:23:35.440 --> 00:23:35.780
Got it.
